                        "review": "\"Paradox Interactive Simulator: Pay to Win Against Your Own Wallet 💸\nYou see the base game on a 75% discount and think, 'Wow, what a steal!' Spoiler alert: You are the one getting robbed.\nBuying the base game is like buying a car, but Paradox delivers only the chassis. You want wheels? Buy the DLC. You want a steering wheel? That’s another DLC. You want to actually design a boat instead of throwing rocks at the enemy? Oops, that’s hidden behind a $20 paywall. Without the 47 different DLCs, the game feels as empty as my bank account after buying them.",
